{
  "_comment": "Non-secret dashboard presentation settings. Copy to config/dashboard.config to use. OpenD connection details and credentials are NOT set here — they come from FUTU_* environment variables read by skills/moomooapi common.get_config(). Risk limits are not configured here.",

